<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Ausdoc year net profit falls.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Ausdoc year net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   10.76 vs 7.76</p>
<p>    Net				     5.54 vs 6.47</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     7.0 vs 5.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Ausdoc Ltd is a computer and stationer supplier. Net profit is before an extraordinary gain of A$13.91 million arising from sale of office products unit. This compared with a $2.95 million year-ago loss. Ausdoc also announced a 10 cent per share special interim dividend, payable September 30, 1997.</p>
